{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52394","headline":"回波乐 三十七 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 三十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大丈夫，游荡出三途。\n荣名何足舍，妻子士（陈校作「有」，项谓「视」之讹）如无。\n法忍先将三毒共，佛性（一）常与六情俱。\n但信研心性妙宝，何烦衣外觅明珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}